package ReviewCenter {
    part def ReviewPage {
        doc /* Page that shows one review with the reader's work first: a next-step line, a compact summary strip (checklist progress with a link to the checklist, the reviewer state, and the open and resolved thread counts), the files, a thread index across all files (filtered by state; choosing a row selects the file and scrolls to and highlights the anchor), and the numbered lines of a selected file with its comment threads, which readers can start, answer, resolve, and reopen (resolved threads collapse to one line). Every file, line and thread has a stable address (/files/{path} with an optional line and side, and /threads/{id}) that opens the page at that place with the line or thread highlighted; choosing a file or thread replaces the address of the browser by its link, every thread has a small plain Link, and an address that names nothing gives a message with a link back to the file list. It also shows each file's change kind for a review from a repository, the source (repository, review-set, commits, selection), and for a file of a review with a baseline a Diff view (the default: the baseline and the head side by side with their own line numbers, unchanged lines collapsed, comments on a line of either version shown under its row; an added file is all added lines and a deleted file all removed lines), the Head version (with comments; not for a deleted file) and a read-only Baseline version (not for an added file). The review's identifier, state, fingerprint, and file hashes are in a collapsed Details section after the reviewers and signing card. It also shows the approval (Approved or In review) with the reviewer slots, where any signed-in user manages the slots, a reviewer signs a slot after entering the password again, and the blockers and the record digest are shown. For an approved review it offers the download of the signed attestation, with a note on the kind of the signing key, or the reason why the key cannot be used. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.ReviewCenter/Web/ReviewPage.razor, ReviewPage.razor.cs, DiffView.razor, DiffView.razor.cs and ReviewLinks.cs (the builder of the file, line and thread addresses) */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.ReviewCenter.Tests/Web/ReviewPageTests.cs, ReviewPageRepositoryTests.cs, ReviewPageDiffTests.cs, ReviewLinksTests.cs and ReviewDeepLinkTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/review-center/web/review-page.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/review-center/web/review-page.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/review-center/web/review-page.yaml */
    }
}
